   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **EFG**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-05-10.mbho.ka300** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 69 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Rain interrupted the show: some tracks went unrecorded and the Meet Me At The Creek track is cut short [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-05-10.mbho.ka300**: taped by DavidPuddy; transferred by DavidPuddy; source: MBHO ka300 > Naiant PFA > MixPre 6 @ 24/48 [1]. Also: Recorded with MBHO ka300 microphones through a Naiant PFA into a MixPre 6 at 24-bit/48kHz, saved to MicroSD; Processed with Audacity (limiter, fades), tracked and encoded to FLAC in CDWAV, tagged in Foobar2000, then uploaded to the LMA [1]",
